  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine the baby lettuce leaves, ferment-kimchi, and chimichurri sauce",
    "In a separate pan, grill the portobello mushrooms until tender",
    "Add the roasted red peppers and crumbly tofu to the bowl",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the salad and sprinkle with salt",
    "Toss the salad gently to combine",
    "Top the salad with the grilled portobello mushrooms",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy",
    "Garnish with additional chimichurri sauce if desired"
